secubox-p2p (1.7.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Absorb the master-link role from secubox-master-link (closes #384)
    - Pre-1.7 secubox-master-link was effectively dead on production:
      its 21-endpoint API was unreachable via nginx, while p2p's own
      /master-link/* endpoints + frontend at /var/www/secubox/master-link/
      provided the live UX all along
    - Add Breaks/Replaces secubox-master-link (<< 1.1) so apt
      full-upgrade removes the orphaned package cleanly
    - Description updated to call out master-link ownership

